Scenario
Here is an overview of Cymbal Software, a company developing autonomous coding assistants for enterprise developers.

Cymbal Software uses gemini-3.1-flash-lite to keep inference costs low while delivering rapid code generation. Currently, the baseline coding agent fails to solve standard development tasks reliably. Your team has identified that the model itself is capable, but the agent's harness—its system instructions, available tools, and verification steps—must be optimized.

Your challenge
As a Senior AI Engineer at Cymbal Software, you are tasked with conducting an evaluation-driven optimization of the agent's harness.

To complete this challenge lab, you must set up the Antigravity evaluation environment, run a baseline evaluation, and analyze the execution trajectories of failed tasks. Using both manual inspection and automated analysis via the Antigravity CLI, you will diagnose the agent's shortcomings. Finally, you will iteratively update the agent until it passes the evaluation tasks.

